   411→/**
   412→ * Calculate Indigenous paradigm score from simulation state
   413→ *
   414→ * Indicators:
   415→ * - Social Trust (40%): state.socialCohesion.trust
   416→ * - Community Bonds (40%): state.socialCohesion.communityBonds
   417→ * - Meaning Crisis (20%): 100 - meaningCrisis (inverted)
   418→ *
   419→ * @param state - Current game state
